摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — run completion, questions, approvals. Zero-dependency Cordis plugin. ｜ DeepSeek Harness（dsh）桌面通知插件：运行结束 / 提问 / 审批时提醒，零依赖 Cordis 插件。","id":"gh:1334344408","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-notify-on-complete","slug":"pitetow/dsh-notify-on-complete","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — run completion, questions, approvals. Zero-depend"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ency Cordis plugin. ｜ DeepSeek Harness（dsh）桌面通知插件：运行结束 / 提问 / 审批时提醒，零依赖 Cordis 插件。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-notify-on-complete — Desktop Notifications for DeepSeek Harness · DeepSeek Harness 桌面通知插件"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Send desktop notifications from DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`): get a system notification when a run finis"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"hes, and an immediate one when the model asks you a question (`ask_user_question`) or waits for appr"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"oval (sandbox escalation / tool permission). The body reflects the result (completed / error / abort"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"alation / tool permission). The body reflects the result (completed / error / aborted / max-tokens)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness（`dsh`）桌面通知插件：运行结束时向系统发送桌面通知；会话进行中模型提问（`ask_user_question`）或等待审批（沙箱提权 / 工具权限）时也会即时提醒"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"你回来处理。正文按结果区分（成功 / 失败 / 中止 / 达到 token 上限）。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Author: Luozy · License: MIT · 中文文档：README.zh.md"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Zero runtime dependencies**: no `dsh` internal packages, no `ctx.shell`. Notifications are fired"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" via `child_process.spawn` as a detached child process — **non-blocking and unaffected by the harnes"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s exit path**.\n- **Cross-platform**: the notifier command is picked from `process.platform` (macOS `"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"osascript` / Linux `notify-send` → `kdialog` / Windows PowerShell). Unsupported platforms are skippe"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"d at load with a warning, never throwing per-event.\n- **System sound**: macOS system sound (`sound n"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ame \"Glass\"`), Windows .NET `SystemSounds`, Linux `canberra-gtk-play` (falls back to `paplay`); disa"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ble with `sound: false`.\n- **In-session blocking notifications**: fires immediately when the model c"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"alls `ask_user_question`, or when a sandbox escalation / tool permission waits for approval — so you"},{"id":"p6s9","text":" know to come back. Controlled by `onBlocked` / `onQuestion` / `onApproval`.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 功能特性（中文）"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **零运行时依赖**：不依赖 dsh 内部包，通知用 `child_process.spawn` 以 detached 子进程发出，不阻塞、不受 harness 退出影响。\n- **跨平台**：m"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"acOS `osascript` / Linux `notify-send` → `kdialog` / Windows PowerShell 自动选择；不支持的平台加载时跳过并警告。\n- **系统提"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"示音**：macOS `sound name \"Glass\"` / Windows SystemSounds / Linux `canberra-gtk-play`（回退 `paplay`）；可用 `"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"sound: false` 关闭。\n- **会话中阻塞即时通知**：模型提问或等待审批时立即提醒你回来；可用 `onBlocked` / `onQuestion` / `onApproval` 精细控"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"制。\n- **只通知顶层运行**：过滤子代理（`header.origin === 'subagent'`），一次 CLI 运行只弹一条。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"完整中文文档见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The plugin listens to two events to decide when \"a run has ended\":"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. **`session/event` → `turn/end`**: records the latest `reason.kind` of a root session (`origin !=="},{"id":"p12s2","text":" 'subagent'`). A run can span many turns (goal rounds, follow-ups, steering), each with its own `tur"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"n/end`; the plugin only remembers the **last** one.\n2. **`agent/status` → `'idle'`**: the harness's "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"own \"run ended\" signal (the web UI's running indicator and `agent.whenIdle()` both derive from it). "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"When the root agent returns to idle, the whole activity has converged, so the plugin sends the recor"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"ded final result once and clears it."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"So **one notification per complete run**, not per turn: a multi-round goal run fires once at the end"},{"id":"p13s2","text":", with the final result; intermediate \"task completed\" moments never fire early. Body format: `resul"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"t — session title (session: sessionId)`, e.g. `任务已完成 — 修复登录bug (session: 3f9a…)`; if the title hasn'"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"t been generated yet it degrades to `result (session: sessionId)`. The title comes from the last `se"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ssion/title` event in the session log — an async projection, so very early notifications (e.g. a que"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"stion right at session start) may not have one yet. Notification commands run with `detached: true` "},{"id":"p13s7","text":"+ `unref()`, so a normal exit or crash never affects delivery."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `reason.kind` | Notification body |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `completed` | 任务已完成 (Task completed) |\n| `error` | 任务失败 (Task failed) |\n| `aborted` | 任务已中止 (Task "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"aborted) |\n| `max-tokens` | 任务达到 token 上限 (Task hit the token limit) |\n| other (unknown) | 任务结束 (Tas"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"\n| `max-tokens` | 任务达到 token 上限 (Task hit the token limit) |\n| other (unknown) | 任务结束 (Task ended) |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Node.js ^22 (same as DeepSeek Harness)\n- An installed `dsh` CLI (any version — the plugin register"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"s via Cordis events and does not depend on a specific CLI version)\n- Peer dependency `@deepseek-ai/c"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ordis@^4.0.1` (provided by the `dsh` CLI itself; pnpm resolves it automatically on install)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Installation (one-liner, GitHub source distribution, no npm)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Prerequisite**: DSH installed (`dsh web` runs), Node.js ^22 + pnpm."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**macOS / Linux / Windows (Git Bash or WSL)**:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Other profiles (default `web`):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The script does 4 things (all idempotent, safe to re-run):"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Downloads the source to `~/.dsh/plugins/dsh-notify-on-complete/` (skips if it exists — **never ov"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"erwrites**; add `--force` to overwrite/update, which asks for confirmation first, or `--yes` to skip"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" it);\n2. Runs `pnpm install && pnpm build`;\n3. Runs `dsh plugin --profile <name> add link:<dir>`: th"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"e CLI reads the package's `dsh.bundle.patch` declaration (`cordis.patch.yml`) and **auto-registers i"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"t into the profile's bundle stack**, so it mounts on the next start — no manual config file edits;\n4"},{"id":"p25s6","text":". Idempotently removes any leftover manual mount lines to avoid double-mounting (two notifications p"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"tently removes any leftover manual mount lines to avoid double-mounting (two notifications per run)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`curl | bash` runs remote code — the script is open source (`scripts/install.sh`); download and revi"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ew it first if you like."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Seeing `- id: notify-on-complete` followed by `name: dsh-notify-on-complete` means the plugin is in "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"the composed tree. Run a real task and watch for a desktop notification to confirm."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Restart to take effect:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **CLI one-shot runs**: the next `dsh --profile headless \"task\"` just works, no extra step.\n- **Web"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" GUI**: restart the web process (stop the current `dsh web`, then start it again). If HMR is enabled"},{"id":"p31s3","text":", saving files also picks it up automatically."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Update"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
